y": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "高考作文结构训练", "ownerName": "user_36c7efa2", "score": 2077.616620932967, "slug": "gaokao-essay-zh", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781582704801, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": true, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1781004113020, "description": "费用催缴管理技能。基于《C+基础保障服务手册-企服管理工作规程》第十一章，实现规范的费用催缴流程，包括智能分级催缴、个性化话术、能耗欠费合并计算等。触发场景：(1) 定时检查费用收缴状态（每天10:00），(2) 手动触发催缴检查（@企服助手 催缴检查），(3) 企微群关键词触发（@催缴），(4) 逾期分级处理（...", "description_zh": "费用催缴管理技能：依据《C+基础保障服务手册-企服管理工作规程》第十一章，实现标准催缴流程，涵盖智能分级催缴、个性化话术、能耗欠费合并计算。触发方式：①每日10:00定时检查收缴状态；②@企服助手手动催缴检查；③企微群关键词@催缴；④逾期分级处理。", "downloads": 106, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/perrykono-debug/fee-collection", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 2, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": 1781004113151, "name": "费用催缴管理", "ownerName": "perrykono-debug", "score": 15451.895043731778, "slug": "fee-collection", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781582699259, "upstream_owner_login": "perrykono-debug", "upstream_url": "https://clawhub.ai/perrykono-debug/fee-collection", "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1778294316091, "description": "This skill should be used when auditing game promotional materials, screenshots, CG images, copywriting, event pages, or launch plans for China mainland compliance, legality, IP risk, cultural/religious risk, sensitive-date conflict, and public-opinion risk. It uses the bundled local knowledge base first, optionally refreshes from zzanezhu's Lexiang personal knowledge base when available, cross-checks external public information, and produces a structured HTML audit report.", "description_zh": "「游戏素材预审」是一套面向游戏宣发素材的合规审核 Skill。\n\n它会优先使用本地内置知识库，对用户提供的图片、截图、文案、活动日期、投放地区等信息进行合规初筛，并在需要时结合公开信息检索，输出结构化审核结论或 HTML 审核报告。\n\n核心能力包括：\n\n中国大陆游戏宣发素材合规审核\n海外重点市场监管趋势辅助判断\n色情低俗、性感化、露肤风险判断\n知识产权与第三方 IP 风险判断\n广告法、虚假宣传、诱导点击风险判断\n未成年人保护、防沉迷、概率披露风险判断\n文化、宗教、民族、全球市场禁忌风险判断\n战争、军事、国旗、真实历史事件风险判断\n敏感日期、舆情扩散、公关预案风险判断\n输出可交付的 HTML 审核报告\n\n适合用于素材上线前的第一轮自查，帮助各位同学快速发现明显风险点，提前减少返工和审核沟通成本。\n\n需要特别说明：本技能输出内容仅作为发布前合规初筛参考，不构成最终审核结论。素材是否可上线、是否需要修改或下架，最终仍应以法务、合规、公关老师的正式判断为准。\n\n欢迎大家拍砖，有哪些风险未识别、规则不准确或建议补充的地方，欢迎企微联系 zzanezhu（朱奕坤）。", "downloads": 106, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_3d72c9b3/game-material-precheck", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/7422abc7-fa86-4505-a723-0575c56e7a2d.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "游戏素材预审", "ownerName": "user_3d72c9b3", "score": 3839.188699746469, "slug": "game-material-precheck", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781582697780, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1780701645421, "description": "OpenClaw 网关服务本地 fork 升级 skill。覆盖 backup → upgrade → env-merge → verify 全流程。专门处理 OpenClaw systemd service 升级时丢失 user 自定义环境变量（CUDA / LD_LIBRARY_PATH / QMD_EMBE...", "description_zh": "OpenClaw 网关服务本地 fork 升级技能，覆盖 backup → upgrade → env-merge → verify 全流程，专门处理 OpenClaw systemd service 升级时丢失的用户自定义环境变量（CUDA / LD_LIBRARY_PATH / QMD_EMBE...）", "downloads": 106, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/axelhu/gateway-upgrade-local-fork", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Gateway Upgrade Local Fork", "ownerName": "axelhu", "score": 10557.768924302789, "slug": "gateway-upgrade-local-fork", "source": "clawhub", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781582693175, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "0.3.0"}, {"category": "", 